<title>JAPAN: Kanto Bank - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kanto Bank - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	    17.26		vs	   19.80</p>
<p> Operating	    2.51		vs	    3.30</p>
<p> Current		1.40		vs	  738    million</p>
<p> Net		  350    million    vs	  325    million</p>
<p> EPS		   37.53 yen	  vs	   34.80 yen</p>
<p> Shares		9 million	  vs	   9 million</p>
<p> Interim div	 25.00 yen	  vs	   25.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Kanto Bank Ltd is an Ibaraki-based regional bank.</p>
